WEBVTT

00:00.880 --> 00:05.880
Brother Biaozhi long time no see in the past when I was imprisoned.

00:06.040 --> 00:10.360
You saved my life this friendship I have always remembered.

00:11.320 --> 00:15.960
Open the gates surrender to me in the future I will not treat you poorly.

00:16.040 --> 00:20.120
Enough talk in the past I saved the one who cared for the world.

00:20.200 --> 00:25.400
Aimed at the north, Prince of Jin even if I could go back even if it meant ending my career.

00:25.480 --> 00:27.480
I would still do the same.

